SUMMARY: THURSDAY (Free event) The Challenges of Modern Dating and Modern 
 Relationships 
DESCRIPTION:NATURE WALKS and FRIENDLY TALKS with SINGLES!\nHello everyone\
 ,\n\n(Free Online Event)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\n**The C
 hallenges of Modern Dating and Modern Relationships** is a one-hour intera
 ctive Zoom discussion hosted and moderated by **Steve Flemming** through t
 he **Soul City Social Club**. Together we'll explore the realities of dati
 ng and relationships in today's fast-changing world—communication\, trus
 t\, expectations\, loneliness\, technology\, emotional connection\, and wh
 at it really takes to build healthy\, lasting relationships. Whether you'r
 e single\, dating\, married\, separated\, or simply interested in understa
 nding the modern relationship landscape\, you're welcome to join this resp
 ectful\, open-minded conversation. Come to share your experiences\, listen
  to others\, and leave with fresh perspectives in a friendly\, supportive\
 , and judgment-free environment.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nArrival Time:\nPlease join us betwe
 en 8:00 pm and 8:10 pm (if you can)\nThe conversation begins right away :)
 \n\n***\n\nCamera's On Please :)\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming\nSoul City So
 cial Club\nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Stev
 eFlemmingSongs/videos\n\n\\*If you do wish to support and contribute to th
 is and these Thursday Night online events that include 3 plus hours of mus
 ic after\; you can do so through e transfer or pay pal to steveflemming11@
 gmail.com\nYou're support and gratitude is greatly appreciated!\n\n**Zoom 
 link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Bonus:**\n**Stick around after
  the event for Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart**\nCanadian Folk 
 and Country Artist\nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/events/315427766/
